WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:15.816
Roxy was sitting in class when her watch beeped.

2
00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:17.996
She raised her hand.

3
00:00:18.016 --> 00:00:20.897
"Miss Apricot, can I go to the nurse?

4
00:00:21.657 --> 00:00:23.818
I, um, don't feel well."

5
00:00:23.838 --> 00:00:27.279
"Of course," Miss Apricot said.

6
00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:32.100
Terrell looked worried, but Roxy quickly gave him a thumbs-up.

7
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.280
Terrell nodded and smiled.

8
00:00:34.161 --> 00:00:35.841
Roxy opened her watch in the hallway.

9
00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:37.842
Cozlin's face appeared.

10
00:00:37.862 --> 00:00:40.042
"Cozlin," Roxy said.

11
00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:41.623
"Is everything okay?"

12
00:00:42.403 --> 00:00:43.283
Cozlin grunted.

13
00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:45.684
"I need your help!"

14
00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:49.485
"I already left school once today," Roxy said.

15
00:00:49.505 --> 00:00:51.165
"What do you need help with?"

16
00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:55.126
"This!" Cozlin moved her wrist so Roxy could see.

17
00:00:56.447 --> 00:00:57.327
Roxy gasped.

18
00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:00.408
Cozlin floated above a broken bridge.

19
00:01:01.076 --> 00:01:03.917
She was holding back a bunch of cars that were about to roll off.

20
00:01:04.817 --> 00:01:05.877
"How did that happen?"

21
00:01:06.238 --> 00:01:06.918
Roxy asked.

22
00:01:06.938 --> 00:01:10.879
"Well Cozlin turned her wrist again.

23
00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:13.019
Roxy's eyes went wide.

24
00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.700
A huge dragon held a bus.

25
00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.161
Delkorians inside the bus shouted.

26
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:21.302
Flames shot from the dragon's mouth.

27
00:01:21.322 --> 00:01:24.463
"Is that the Roxy scowled.

28
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:26.883
"You stole the gold, didn't you?"

29
00:01:27.804 --> 00:01:28.944
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

30
00:01:29.824 --> 00:01:32.225
"Just jump through the portal when it opens.

31
00:01:32.446 --> 00:01:34.187
Please!" Voop!

32
00:01:35.007 --> 00:01:35.888
A portal opened.

33
00:01:36.768 --> 00:01:38.849
Roxy turned into Rocket Girl and jumped through.

34
00:01:41.491 --> 00:01:43.232
She landed on the roof of a building.

35
00:01:43.952 --> 00:01:45.233
It had an enormous hole.

36
00:01:46.113 --> 00:01:47.434
A Delkorian hurried over.

37
00:01:47.454 --> 00:01:49.235
"I'm Zark.

38
00:01:49.735 --> 00:01:50.736
You must be Rocket Girl.

39
00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:52.957
A dragon is destroying our city!"

40
00:01:52.977 --> 00:01:54.378
"Don't worry.

41
00:01:54.878 --> 00:01:55.959
I'll help Kid Comet."

42
00:01:56.699 --> 00:01:57.480
Roxy took off.

43
00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.121
She saw the broken bridge and flew to it.

44
00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:03.042
Cozlin was still holding back all the cars.

45
00:02:03.062 --> 00:02:05.383
"There are too many!

46
00:02:05.403 --> 00:02:07.044
I need your help!"

47
00:02:08.104 --> 00:02:10.045
Roxy grabbed a car and brought it to the ground.

48
00:02:11.306 --> 00:02:13.206
The Delkorian inside smiled.

49
00:02:13.226 --> 00:02:14.787
"Thank you so much!"

50
00:02:15.607 --> 00:02:18.929
Roxy flew back to the bridge and moved one car after another.

51
00:02:19.309 --> 00:02:22.370
Finally she and Cozlin brought the last two cars to the ground.

52
00:02:23.611 --> 00:02:26.312
Roar! The dragon soared over them.

53
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.261
It still held the bus.

54
00:02:29.541 --> 00:02:31.583
Roxy and Cozlin shot toward the dragon.

55
00:02:32.423 --> 00:02:35.825
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams hit the dragon.

56
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:38.786
The dragon threw the bus at her.

57
00:02:39.347 --> 00:02:40.547
Passengers screamed.

58
00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.131
Roxy caught the bus and set it down gently.

59
00:02:48.532 --> 00:02:49.552
The driver crawled out.

60
00:02:49.572 --> 00:02:51.894
"I need a new job!"

61
00:02:53.294 --> 00:02:56.016
Fwoosh! Flames shot toward Roxy.

62
00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.121
She blew her freeze breath at them.

63
00:02:59.222 --> 00:03:00.904
A cloud of smoke formed in the air.

64
00:03:01.884 --> 00:03:03.045
Zap! Zap!

65
00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:05.547
Cozlin fired lasers at the dragon.

66
00:03:06.048 --> 00:03:07.489
It spun around and chased her.

67
00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.170
Roxy caught up to her.

68
00:03:09.971 --> 00:03:11.412
Cozlin spoke into a device.

69
00:03:11.432 --> 00:03:14.475
"Zark! Get ready to open the portal!

70
00:03:14.955 --> 00:03:16.957
Hopefully the dragon will fly through it."

71
00:03:16.977 --> 00:03:18.478
"I'm ready!"

72
00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:19.459
Zark said.

73
00:03:19.479 --> 00:03:23.842
"We also need to return that gold," Roxy said.

74
00:03:24.523 --> 00:03:25.404
Cozlin sighed.

75
00:03:25.984 --> 00:03:30.508
"Fine." They flew fast, zigzagging to dodge the dragon's flames.

76
00:03:34.651 --> 00:03:36.092
Zark!" Cozlin said.

77
00:03:36.112 --> 00:03:37.654
"I'll head straight toward him.

78
00:03:38.154 --> 00:03:40.436
Then, when he opens the portal, I'll turn quickly.

79
00:03:40.856 --> 00:03:42.698
Hopefully the dragon will fly right in!"

80
00:03:43.378 --> 00:03:44.920
Cozlin led the dragon toward the roof.

81
00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.081
Its jaws snapped at her feet.

82
00:03:48.222 --> 00:03:49.904
Roxy saw a portal pop open.

83
00:03:53.376 --> 00:03:55.777
Cozlin followed the plan and turned fast.

84
00:03:56.298 --> 00:03:57.538
But the dragon turned too.

85
00:03:57.558 --> 00:04:00.120
"Ugh!" Roxy thought.

86
00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:03.261
"That dragon's as fast as—" Voop!

87
00:04:03.882 --> 00:04:05.242
Another portal suddenly opened.

88
00:04:05.763 --> 00:04:08.484
Cozlin disappeared into it, and so did the dragon!

89
00:04:13.807 --> 00:04:15.108
Roxy rushed over to Zark.

90
00:04:16.749 --> 00:04:17.889
"Open the portal again!

91
00:04:18.409 --> 00:04:21.211
Kid Comet is trapped in the chamber with that dragon!"

92
00:04:21.931 --> 00:04:22.952
Zark looked shocked.

93
00:04:23.921 --> 00:04:25.367
"I didn't open that portal."
